<title>USA: SyQuest offers rebate on EZFlyer 230.</title>
<headline>SyQuest offers rebate on EZFlyer 230.</headline>
<dateline>FREMONT, Calif. 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>SyQuest Technology said on Tuesday it will offer a $55 rebate on the purchase of any EZFlyer 230, SyQuest's newest line of high-speed, 3.5-inch, 230 MB, removable cartridge hard drives.</p>
<p>The company said the program will run from November 4 through December 31.</p>
<p>The EZFlyer has a suggested retail price of $299.</p>
</text>
